WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:06.965
Gramps, don't push yourself too hard.

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:09.592
I get it now.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:14.055
Your glib remarks weren't just for show.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.975
I've got a little better understanding
of you now.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:21.771
But tell me one more thing!

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:28.486
I don't sense the fires of hatred
for the gods in your eyes.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:35.368
Tell me the real reason
why you've come to fight the gods.

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.874
Even you are asking me that?

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:43.251
You're all a bunch of idiots.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.128
Hatred?

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:46.546
Revenge?

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:50.008
I don't need any of those.
I have no reason.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:53.011
When protecting your children,

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:59.309
do you need a reason?

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:07.692
Darling…

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.277
That's so like Dad.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.695
That's for sure.

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.530
All humanity,

00:01:13.323 --> 00:01:14.491
the children of Adam,

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:17.869
silently trembled at their father's words

00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:20.997
that were filled with such
tremendous love.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.626
Then, even though no one told them to,

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:29.255
for the first time in history,
all of mankind came together as one

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:34.010
and prayed for one thing…

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:37.514
For their father, Adam's victory!

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:43.436
Mankind, at this moment,
has just come together as one!

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:47.524
This lad really is quite nice.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:52.779
Brünnhilde, that Adam is so totally cool!

00:01:53.363 --> 00:01:57.283
It seems we were all mistaken

00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.161
about this man called Adam.

